rs?\u201d</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What did the zookeeper say?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He said the bear might ask, \u201cDo you mind if I eat this little girl instead?\u201d", "id": 3, "time": "35000", "image": "engenn5le15ob09re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about places and attractions in a city. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can ask and report about things actions, events or people. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can ask for and give permission. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you like to go to the zoo? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What's your favorite animal? "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Everyone likes the zoo!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "co